matching rules and dictionaries in scripts/) are protected under the Copyright Act of the Republic of
Korea, including the database producer's right in Chapter 4 of that Act. You may view the repository
and fork it as permitted by the GitHub Terms of Service. You may not copy, modify, redistribute, host,
scrape, or use any part of it to train, fine-tune or evaluate machine-learning models without the
prior written permission of the rights holder.

Public data collected from the Ministry of Food and Drug Safety (foodsafetykorea.go.kr) and the Korean
public data portal (data.go.kr) remains subject to those providers' own terms; the rights holder claims
no rights in that source data itself. Third-party components (Tailwind CSS, lucide, Pretendard) keep
their own licenses.
